      ⍝!MODES (C)
      ⍝ (C) '80's commands, after APL80, typed in APL80's characters.
      ⍝ Functions are defined with )DEF and changed with )EDIT; an empty
      ⍝ line, for BREAK, ends one. There is no del.
      ∇Z←F X
